# Variant series "sched73" for --target 7.2 (ADR-009; opt-in: HYPHAED_SERIES_VARIANT=sched73).
#
# The v7.3 scheduler stack on 7.2.15: cgroup task-migrate notifier (0036), sched_ext 7.3 (0037), the single-runqueue EEVDF
# fair class with cgroup_mode (0038), then the CachyOS 7.3 BORE, which is written against exactly that fair.c. Everything after BORE is the default 7.2 series unchanged.
# Do NOT also enable series.experimental's 0031-0035: the transplant already contains them.
# Why and how: docs/research/7.2.15-patch-sweep-2026-11-04.md. Never the default until the two-run A/B (hyphaed/round.py).
